@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Sans
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam roundCorner 5
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title ST-01: Login thành công — LOW / MEDIUM risk (2026-10-05)

box "User" #D5E8D4
participant "User\nBrowser/App" as U
end box

box "Core App" #DAE8FC
participant "Auth API" as CA
database "core-db" as CDB
end box

box "Detection Engine" #FFF2CC
participant "pre-token-check" as DE
end box

U -> CA : **POST /api/v1/auth/login**\n(username, password)
activate CA

CA -> CDB : SELECT users\nWHERE username=?
activate CDB
CDB --> CA : user record
deactivate CDB

CA -> CA : Argon2id.verify(password, hash)
alt credentials INVALID
    CA -> CDB : INSERT login_attempt\n(outcome=failure)
    activate CDB
    deactivate CDB
    CA --> U : **401 Invalid credentials**
    destroy CA
else credentials VALID
    CA -> CDB : INSERT login_attempt\n(outcome=success)
    activate CDB
    deactivate CDB

    == Risk Gate (SYNCHRONOUS, timeout 3s) ==

    CA -> DE : **POST /internal/pre-token-check**\n(user_id, ip, ua, event_id)
    activate DE
    DE -> DE : scoring pipeline\n(no full login context\n→ quick look-up)
    note right of DE
      combined < 0.50
      → risk_level = LOW / MEDIUM
      → require_mfa = false
      → degraded = false
    end note
    DE --> CA : **200 {risk_level, require_mfa: false,\ndegraded: false}**
    deactivate DE

    alt require_mfa = false (LOW/MEDIUM)
        CA -> CDB : INSERT sessions\n(token_jti, hashes, expires_at)
        activate CDB
        deactivate CDB
        CA --> U : **200 OK**\n{access_token, refresh_token}
        destroy CA
        note right of U
          Normal login — no extra delay.
          Detection is consulted but does NOT block.
        end note
    end alt
end alt

legend bottom
  **2026-10-05 key points:**
  - Token issued IMMEDIATELY for LOW/MEDIUM
  - FAIL OPEN: if /pre-token-check errors → allow login
  - Response time ~same as before (async is NOT blocking here)
endlegend
@enduml
